 allocation is the division of money among categories such as equity, debt and cash. Diversification spreads exposure within and across those categories."}],["$","p","The aim is not to eliminate every loss, but to avoid allowing one investment or type of risk to determine the entire outcome.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"The aim is not to eliminate every loss, but to avoid allowing one investment or type of risk to determine the entire outcome."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Your allocation is personal",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"Your allocation is personal"}],[["$","p","A suitable mix depends on the goal, time horizon, income stability, emergency reserves and capacity to accept a fall in value. Copying another investor's allocation can produce the wrong risk level.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"A suitable mix depends on the goal, time horizon, income stability, emergency reserves and capacity to accept a fall in value. Copying another investor's allocation can produce the wrong risk level."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Overlap can hide concentration",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"Overlap can hide concentration"}],[["$","p","Several funds may own many of the same companies or bonds. The number of schemes is therefore a poor measure of diversification by itself.",{"className":"mt-4 leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Several funds may own many of the same companies or bonds. The number of schemes is therefore a poor measure of diversification by itself."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Rebalancing",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl font-bold","children":"Rebalancing"}],["$L4","$L5"],"$undefined"]}]]}],"$L6"]}]}],"$L7"]}],["$L8","$L9"],"$La"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"4FcUJzdRI2rWqun7miPuW"}
